WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.478
Welcome to Orbit. Ready for the real world. Our focus is Questions in context.

2
00:00:07.478 --> 00:00:16.622
Use the correct question word and auxiliary. Where asks about place, when about time, and how long about duration.

3
00:00:16.622 --> 00:00:20.621
When do classes start? At six.

4
00:00:20.621 --> 00:00:25.399
How long do you practise? For twenty minutes.

5
00:00:25.399 --> 00:00:29.234
Where does Maya study? At Orbit.

6
00:00:29.234 --> 00:00:38.631
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
